    <description>Trace — a clipboard manager that lives on the left edge of your screen and expands on hover.

Features:
* Zero-click panel: hover the left screen edge to expand
* Native OLE drag &amp; drop to any desktop application
* Task layer and AI suggestion pipeline
* Windows 10/11 (x64) only

Installed via the official NSIS installer (silent, per-user). The application updates itself from GitHub Releases via electron-updater.
</description>
    <summary>Zero-click clipboard manager for Windows</summary>
    <tags>clipboard clipboard-manager windows electron productivity</tags>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/PaRr0tBoY/Trace/releases</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
